","title":"Keep or Return?","panels":[{"scene":"🧥","bubbles":[["Ana","I kept this coat for a year."],["Leo","Why not return it?"]],"cap":"Panel 1"},{"scene":"🧾","bubbles":[["Ana","I lost the receipt."],["Leo","Then keep it!"]],"cap":"Panel 2"},{"scene":"📦","bubbles":[["Ana","I kept all the boxes."],["Leo","Keep warm, not boxes!"]],"cap":"Panel 3"},{"scene":"😂","bubbles":[["Ana","I returned the boxes!"],["Leo","At last!"]],"cap":"Panel 4"}],"gloss":[["receipt","recibo"],["box","caixa"],["at last","finalmente"],["warm","aquecido"]],"say":""}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Ana kept the coat for a year.","ans":"T","why":"kept for a year."},{"q":"She kept the receipt.","ans":"F","why":"lost the receipt."},{"q":"She returned the boxes.","ans":"T","why":"Painel 4."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“at last” = ?","opts":["finalmente","no último","no fim"],"ans":0,"why":"at last."},{"q":"“receipt” = ?","opts":["recibo","receita","recepção"],"ans":0,"why":"receipt."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"keep: past and uses","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["guardar","**I kept the coat.**"],["continuar","**Keep walking.**"],["manter","**Keep warm.**"],["cumprir","**keep a promise**"],["return","**return = devolver**"]],"cap":"keep: past and uses"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Passado: **keep – kept – kept**. *keep + -ing*: continuar a fazer."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ the coat for a year. (keep)","a":"kept","why":"keep-kept."},{"s":"___ warm! (keep)","a":"Keep","why":"imperativo."},{"s":"She ___ the boxes. (return)","a":"returned","why":"regular."},{"s":"Please ___ walking. (keep)","a":"keep","why":"keep + -ing."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["coat","casaco"],["receipt","recibo"],["box","caixa"]